    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (1) yang dinomborkan semula subperenggan yang berikut: “(2) Notwithstanding subparagraph (1), income tax shall be charged for a year of assessment on the chargeable income of a company other than a company to which paragraph 2A applies which has chargeable income exceeding one hundred million ringgit in the basis period for the year of assessment 2022 at the following rates: Chargeable RM Rate of income income tax For every ringgit 100,000,000 24 per cent of the first For every ringgit 100,000,000 33 per cent”; dan exceeding"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26__para_b",
