      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas Bahagian XVIII bahagian yang berikut: “PArt XIX Notwithstanding Parts I, II and IV, income tax shall be charged for a year of assessment on the income of a unit holder other than an individual referred to in section 109dA which is derived from Malaysia at the rate of 24 per cent of gross. PART XX Notwithstanding Parts I and IV, income tax shall be charged on the income of a person who is a resident which is received in Malaysia from outside Malaysia at the rate of 3 per cent of gross.”. Pindaan Jadual 6"
      }
    },
    {
