      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 4, 6, 13, 14, 16, 17, 18, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25 dan 27, perenggan 5(a), perenggan 5(b) berhubung dengan perenggan 6(1)(o)Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 dan perenggan 26(b) berhubung dengan Bahagian XIX Jadual 1 kepada Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2022."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 7, 10, 11, 12, 15, 19 dan 28, perenggan 9(b) berhubung dengan subperenggan 46(1)(h)(iii) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 dan perenggan 9(c) berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2022 dan tahun-tahun taksiran yang berikutnya."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 5 (b) berhubung dengan perenggan 6(1)(p) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 dan perenggan 26(b) berhubung dengan Bahagian XX Jadual 1 kepada Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 mula berkuat kuasa dari 1 Januari 2022 hingga 30 Jun 2022."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 8 disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2019 dan tahun-tahun taksiran yang berikutnya."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 9(a), (d), (g) dan (h) berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2022 dan 2023."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 9(b) berhubung dengan subperenggan 46(1)(h)(i) dan (ii) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2021 dan tahun-tahun taksiran yang berikutnya."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 9(e) berhubung dengan subperenggan 46(1)(s)(i) dan (ii) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 dan perenggan 26(a) berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2022."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 9(e) berhubung dengan subperenggan 46(1)(s)(iii) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 dan perenggan 9(f) berkuat kuasa bagi tahun taksiran 2021 dan 2022. Pindaan seksyen 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 5(1A) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “109d,” perkataan “109dA in respect of a non-resident unit holder other than an individual,”. Pindaan seksyen 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 6(1) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (n), dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan itu dengan koma bernoktah; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (n) perenggan yang berikut: “(o) subject to section 109dA but notwithstanding any other provisions of this Act, income tax shall be charged for each year of assessment upon the income of a unit holder other than an individual which consists of interest distributed or credited by a unit trust that is a retail money market fund referred to in subsection 61(1A) at the appropriate rate as specified under Part XIX of Schedule 1; (p) income tax shall be charged upon the income of a person who is a resident which is received in Malaysia from outside Malaysia from 1 January 2022 until 30 June 2022 at the appropriate rate as specified under Part XX of Schedule 1.”. Pindaan seksyen 6d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perenggan 6d(3)(c) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “31 December 2021” dengan perkataan “31 December 2022”. Pindaan seksyen 39"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_II__cl_7__para_a",
