      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan memotong perkataan “or” di hujung perenggan itu;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (d), dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan itu dengan koma bernoktah; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (d) perenggan yang berikut: “(e) to obtain a review of an assessment in a case where section 38A applies; or (f) to obtain a refund of duty paid in a case where section 57, 58 or 80b, or subsection 21(7), 39(4) or 80(3) applies.”. Seksyen baharu 77c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 77b seksyen yang berikut: “Tax identification number 77c. For the purposes of this Act, every person shall use the tax identification number assigned by the Director General under section 66A of the Income Tax Act 1967.”. Pindaan Jadual Pertama"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual Pertama kepada Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan butiran 31 dan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya dengan butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut: “31 CONTRACT NOTE: Relating to the sale of any shares, stock or marketable securities in companies incorporated in Malaysia or elsewhere— (a) For every RM1,000 or fractional part of RM1,000 of the value of any shares or stock (b) For every RM1,000 or fractional part of RM1,000 of the value of any marketable securities"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IX",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "IX",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/12/msa@/~chp_IX__cl_66",
